✨ Features

Create new tasks

View all tasks

Update existing tasks

Delete tasks

Real-time UI updates without page refresh

Responsive UI using Bootstrap


Bootstrap

JavaScript (Fetch / AJAX)

🧠 Project Architecture & Implementation

Django Models
Designed models to store task information such as task title, completion status, and timestamps.

REST APIs
Implemented CRUD operations using Django REST Framework. APIs follow RESTful standards, enabling clean communication between frontend and backend.

Frontend Integration
Integrated REST APIs with the frontend using JavaScript Fetch/AJAX to perform asynchronous operations and improve user experience.\

